le="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260801/zhanbao_image_2113488_1785520018_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260801/zhanbao_image_2113488_1785520018_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">道格拉斯·路易斯、奥博沃破门，尤文2-0击败尼斯，取得友谊赛两连胜。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/match2123235date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无缘决赛！中国足球小将红队0-2亚洲明星联，后者决赛战杭州足管</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312234417911.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312234417911.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312234417911.jpg"> </div><p>2034杯冠军组半决赛，中国足球小将红队0-2不敌<span style=" 51, 51);">亚洲明星联</span>，无缘决赛。2034杯决赛将由杭州足管对阵亚洲明星联。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-01/6a6d2d5f56734native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">因凡蒂诺：出售股份计划不再符合最初设定目标，该提案将不再推进</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260226/699ff4701371f.jpg"> </div><p>天空体育独家消息，因凡蒂诺确认取消世界杯股份出售计划。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-01/6a6d1be6eaa4bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">美媒：引发全球愤怒，国际足联将取消世界杯股份出售计划</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4bbad8ad53e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4bbad8ad53e_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260706/6a4bbad8ad53e_720.jpg"> </div><p>据《纽约邮报》报道，在引发众怒后，国际足联将取消成立商业子公司出售股份的计划。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6cb8ad497f8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">已被禁赛近2年！英足总官方：穆德里克已经解禁，可立即重返赛场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312308213827.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312308213827.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312308213827.jpg"> </div><p>英足总官方发布公告，穆德里克已经正式解禁，此前他因涉嫌违反反兴奋剂规则被禁赛近2年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6cbab78f3c3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">I'M BACK！穆德里克发文：4年禁赛期解除！我将努力训练重返赛场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.21" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312309493318_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.21" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.21" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312309493318_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260731/202607312309493318_720.jpg"> </div><p>解禁之后，穆德里克在社媒发布长文，释放情绪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-01/6a6d0bf204b46native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">南美足联：要求FIFA就FFE项目提供补充信息和说明 足球永远至上</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/202608010456597815.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/202608010456597815.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260801/202608010456597815.jpg"> </div><p>南美足联发表公告，就国际足联成立商业子公司进行回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-01/6a6d109914e06native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">各洲齐发声！欧|中北美|亚足联明确反对FIFA，南美足联未明确表态</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg"> </div><p>南美足协发文进行回应后，各洲足联已经均对FIFA的这次改革进行了发声。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-31/6a6c59d7423a9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">带队近5年！官方：纽卡主帅埃迪·豪离任，曾率纽卡夺70年来首冠</a></p>